    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, the ultimate <strong>sandbox game</strong> where you become the architect of your dreams. Craft personalized homes, design entire communities, and shape a thriving civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the present and lead as a visionary strategist. Balance society\u2019s desires with economic demands across industries like energy, technology, and agriculture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/40b5d40af800fff0a7e2c9786fad5235.avif?t=1745595282\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>street systems</strong> to individual rooms in industrial buildings or family homes - with Empluna you can create anything you can imagine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Empluna you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design, furnish and <strong>build your own houses</strong> and industrial facilities</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create <strong>road networks</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan <strong>rail networks</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design <strong>landscapes</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce <strong>resources</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill <strong>social needs</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And so much more</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/32c579ac5556a37a202261c8c639f1f5.avif?t=1745595282\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(A simple sawmill in the buildsystem)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empluna takes place in the <strong>Modern Era</strong>: The 21st century is marked by groundbreaking technological advancements and sleek, modern architectural marvels. This era seamlessly intertwines with a rich tapestry of diverse lifestyles, flourishing prosperity, and a myriad of bustling industries. And more to come.<br><br><strong>Economy:</strong> As you navigate through the game, you\u2019ll be tasked with skillfully juggling multiple industries, each with its own distinct requirements and interdependencies. Your role will encompass orchestrating trade activities, effectively managing the flow of imports and exports. Additionally, you\u2019ll be entrusted with the responsibility of upholding a robust financial market and promoting sustainable energy production practices. By delving into the realm of agriculture, you\u2019ll ensure a reliable source of nourishment, while your involvement in the construction sector will allow you to shape the evolving urban environment.<br><br><strong>Society:</strong> Addressing the requirements of a contemporary society becomes your paramount mission. You\u2019ll be engaged in fulfilling various needs and executing tasks, such as constructing your very own museum or school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/9962f89301cf49f67df87125b03df3ca.avif?t=1745595282\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, the ultimate <strong>sandbox game</strong> where you become the architect of your dreams. Craft personalized homes, design entire communities, and shape a thriving civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the present and lead as a visionary strategist. Balance society\u2019s desires with economic demands across industries like energy, technology, and agriculture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/40b5d40af800fff0a7e2c9786fad5235.avif?t=1745595282\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>street systems</strong> to individual rooms in industrial buildings or family homes - with Empluna you can create anything you can imagine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Empluna you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design, furnish and <strong>build your own houses</strong> and industrial facilities</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create <strong>road networks</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan <strong>rail networks</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design <strong>landscapes</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce <strong>resources</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill <strong>social needs</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And so much more</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/32c579ac5556a37a202261c8c639f1f5.avif?t=1745595282\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(A simple sawmill in the buildsystem)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empluna takes place in the <strong>Modern Era</strong>: The 21st century is marked by groundbreaking technological advancements and sleek, modern architectural marvels. This era seamlessly intertwines with a rich tapestry of diverse lifestyles, flourishing prosperity, and a myriad of bustling industries. And more to come.<br><br><strong>Economy:</strong> As you navigate through the game, you\u2019ll be tasked with skillfully juggling multiple industries, each with its own distinct requirements and interdependencies. Your role will encompass orchestrating trade activities, effectively managing the flow of imports and exports. Additionally, you\u2019ll be entrusted with the responsibility of upholding a robust financial market and promoting sustainable energy production practices. By delving into the realm of agriculture, you\u2019ll ensure a reliable source of nourishment, while your involvement in the construction sector will allow you to shape the evolving urban environment.<br><br><strong>Society:</strong> Addressing the requirements of a contemporary society becomes your paramount mission. You\u2019ll be engaged in fulfilling various needs and executing tasks, such as constructing your very own museum or school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/9962f89301cf49f67df87125b03df3ca.avif?t=1745595282\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
